 "_rules": "Applied to the Hakka after the words, in order: [pattern, replacement], Python regex. The first group catch, inside words the segmenter kept whole (所說, 卻是, 配給), the characters that are Mandarin wherever they stand, sparing the few words where they are not (於是, 的確, 目的, 其他, 小說, 沉沒); then a count of days in 天 becomes 日, a question's 嗎 becomes 無, and the quotation marks become 「」.",
 "rules": [
  [
   "告訴(你兜|佢兜|𠊎兜|你|佢|𠊎|[^，。；：、「」『』！？\\s]{1,6}?)講",
   "同\\1講"
  ],
  [
   "告訴(你兜|佢兜|𠊎兜|你|佢|𠊎)",
   "同\\1講"
  ],
  [
   "(?<![於凡])是(?!非)",
   "係"
  ],
  [
   "(?<![目標])的(?![確])",
   "个"
  ],
  [
   "(?<![小傳遊])說(?!服)",
   "講"
  ],
  [
   "(?<!其)他(?![人國鄉])",
   "佢"
  ],
  [
   "我",
   "𠊎"
  ],
  [
   "誰",
   "麼人"
  ],
  [
   "(?<![沉埋淹])沒(?!收)",
   "無"
  ],
